Dialogue: 4,0:18:21.84,0:18:25.85,Ref,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\pos(960,650)}2 Corinthians 12:9 (KJV)
Dialogue: 4,0:00:02.00,0:00:03.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,If you woke tired,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:03.12,0:00:04.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,pray with me for strength
Dialogue: 4,0:00:04.89,0:00:07.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,to meet this day with God.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:07.61,0:00:09.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may have opened your eyes
Dialogue: 4,0:00:09.70,0:00:12.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,already wishing for more rest.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:12.04,0:00:14.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let your shoulders settle,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:14.02,0:00:15.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,wherever you are.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:15.50,0:00:17.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can keep your eyes open
Dialogue: 4,0:00:17.64,0:00:19.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,and your breathing easy.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:19.71,0:00:21.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can join each prayer
Dialogue: 4,0:00:21.64,0:00:24.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,in your own voice or listen quietly.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:24.72,0:00:27.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bring the tiredness you actually feel.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:27.80,0:00:31.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,You have room here to begin honestly.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:31.94,0:00:33.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,Everlasting Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:33.43,0:00:35.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,I come to you with the morning
Dialogue: 4,0:00:35.79,0:00:36.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:36.34,0:00:38.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,including the heaviness
Dialogue: 4,0:00:38.15,0:00:40.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,I wish I could leave behind.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:40.53,0:00:43.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,I need your strength before I begin
Dialogue: 4,0:00:43.23,0:00:45.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,measuring what this day requires.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:45.96,0:00:48.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,Receive my scattered thoughts
Dialogue: 4,0:00:48.02,0:00:50.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,and my small willingness to pray.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:50.55,0:00:51.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,Meet me in the room
Dialogue: 4,0:00:51.99,0:00:52.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,where I am,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:52.83,0:00:55.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,among the things waiting to be done.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:55.74,0:00:57.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,I want to learn how to depend
Dialogue: 4,0:00:57.71,0:00:59.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,on you while taking care
Dialogue: 4,0:00:59.34,0:01:01.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,of the life you have given me.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:02.56,0:01:04.68,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Hast thou not known?
Dialogue: 5,0:01:04.68,0:01:06.33,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}hast thou not heard,
Dialogue: 5,0:01:06.33,0:01:08.40,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}that the everlasting God,
Dialogue: 5,0:01:08.40,0:01:09.14,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}the LORD,
Dialogue: 5,0:01:09.14,0:01:11.04,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}the Creator of the ends
Dialogue: 5,0:01:11.04,0:01:12.12,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}of the earth,
Dialogue: 5,0:01:12.12,0:01:14.86,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}fainteth not, neither is weary?
Dialogue: 4,0:01:14.86,0:01:16.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,there is no searching
Dialogue: 4,0:01:16.48,0:01:18.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,of his understanding.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:19.58,0:01:23.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,Isaiah begins with the everlasting God.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:23.12,0:01:25.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,Before you examine your own
Dialogue: 4,0:01:25.23,0:01:26.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,supply of strength,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:26.72,0:01:29.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,you are invited to remember him.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:29.42,0:01:30.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may see only
Dialogue: 4,0:01:30.75,0:01:33.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,the hours directly ahead.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:33.01,0:01:34.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may feel that everyone
Dialogue: 4,0:01:34.87,0:01:36.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,expects something from you.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:36.99,0:01:39.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,The Creator's understanding reaches
Dialogue: 4,0:01:39.74,0:01:42.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,beyond what you can hold in mind.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:42.52,0:01:44.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,As you hear this passage,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:44.23,0:01:46.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,let your attention widen from
Dialogue: 4,0:01:46.21,0:01:48.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,the demands of the morning toward
Dialogue: 4,0:01:48.46,0:01:51.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,the God to whom you are praying.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:51.83,0:01:52.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:52.19,0:01:54.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,you know the effort hidden
Dialogue: 4,0:01:54.08,0:01:56.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,beneath my ordinary appearance.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:56.51,0:01:58.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,You know the interrupted rest,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:58.84,0:02:00.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,the decisions made quietly,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:00.93,0:02:03.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the concern I carry while
Dialogue: 4,0:02:03.18,0:02:05.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,answering that everything is fine.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:05.99,0:02:08.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can speak more plainly with you.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:08.76,0:02:10.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,I am tired of holding
Dialogue: 4,0:02:10.60,0:02:12.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,so much inside.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:12.09,0:02:13.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me the wisdom to name
Dialogue: 4,0:02:13.97,0:02:16.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,what is heavy and the courage
Dialogue: 4,0:02:16.07,0:02:18.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,to let someone trustworthy know.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:18.56,0:02:20.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,I receive this moment as
Dialogue: 4,0:02:20.61,0:02:22.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,a place to stop pretending
Dialogue: 4,0:02:22.82,0:02:25.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,that I have endless reserves.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:26.46,0:02:28.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,He giveth power to the faint;
Dialogue: 4,0:02:28.86,0:02:30.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,and to them that have no
Dialogue: 4,0:02:30.58,0:02:33.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,might he increaseth strength.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:34.14,0:02:37.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,Listen to whom this verse addresses:
Dialogue: 4,0:02:37.03,0:02:37.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,the faint,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:37.77,0:02:40.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,and those who have no might.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:40.03,0:02:41.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can hear it from
Dialogue: 4,0:02:41.62,0:02:43.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,the place you occupy today.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:43.94,0:02:45.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can acknowledge
Dialogue: 4,0:02:45.36,0:02:48.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,that a responsibility feels too large.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:48.39,0:02:50.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can admit that your usual
Dialogue: 4,0:02:50.92,0:02:53.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,enthusiasm is missing.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:53.02,0:02:54.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,You have something
Dialogue: 4,0:02:54.38,0:02:56.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,honest to bring to God.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:56.30,0:02:58.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,Allow yourself to ask for strength
Dialogue: 4,0:02:58.74,0:03:01.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,before you have worked out exactly how
Dialogue: 4,0:03:01.47,0:03:04.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,you will manage the next several hours.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:05.46,0:03:06.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,Creator,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:06.12,0:03:08.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,I thank you for my body,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:08.10,0:03:09.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,even on a morning
Dialogue: 4,0:03:09.50,0:03:11.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,when it feels slow.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:11.25,0:03:13.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,Teach me to treat it with care.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:13.73,0:03:16.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me notice the need for food,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:16.56,0:03:18.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,water, movement, or rest,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:18.71,0:03:21.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,and respond as I am able.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:21.04,0:03:23.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,When tiredness needs attention
Dialogue: 4,0:03:23.27,0:03:25.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,beyond what I understand,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:25.13,0:03:28.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,give me sense to seek appropriate care.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:28.22,0:03:29.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let my plans respect
Dialogue: 4,0:03:29.75,0:03:32.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,the limits I am living with.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:32.08,0:03:34.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask for patience with myself
Dialogue: 4,0:03:34.46,0:03:36.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,as I learn a more considerate
Dialogue: 4,0:03:36.76,0:03:39.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,way to move through today.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:40.01,0:03:40.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:40.58,0:03:42.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,bring order to the first
Dialogue: 4,0:03:42.52,0:03:43.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,hour before me.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:43.92,0:03:45.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can see several things
Dialogue: 4,0:03:45.78,0:03:47.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,asking for attention,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:47.41,0:03:48.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,and I feel the urge
Dialogue: 4,0:03:48.88,0:03:50.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,to begin them all.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:50.46,0:03:52.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,Show me which responsibility
Dialogue: 4,0:03:52.64,0:03:54.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,truly comes first.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:54.22,0:03:56.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me gather what I need,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:56.25,0:03:57.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,clear a little space,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:57.84,0:04:00.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,and make a beginning I can sustain.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:00.65,0:04:01.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let a simple start
Dialogue: 4,0:04:01.92,0:04:03.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,be enough for this moment.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:03.92,0:04:06.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep me attentive to the work
Dialogue: 4,0:04:06.10,0:04:08.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,in my hands rather than spending
Dialogue: 4,0:04:08.51,0:04:10.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,my strength imagining every
Dialogue: 4,0:04:10.54,0:04:12.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,task still waiting.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:13.15,0:04:14.67,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Even the youths shall
Dialogue: 5,0:04:14.67,0:04:16.05,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}faint and be weary,
Dialogue: 5,0:04:16.05,0:04:19.09,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and the young men shall utterly fall:
Dialogue: 4,0:04:20.22,0:04:22.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,You have just heard Scripture
Dialogue: 4,0:04:22.17,0:04:24.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,acknowledge weariness in people
Dialogue: 4,0:04:24.26,0:04:26.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,who might appear strongest.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:26.26,0:04:28.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may be comparing this
Dialogue: 4,0:04:28.01,0:04:29.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,morning with a season when
Dialogue: 4,0:04:29.82,0:04:31.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,you could do much more.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:31.61,0:04:33.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may be watching someone
Dialogue: 4,0:04:33.42,0:04:35.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,whose pace looks effortless.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:35.48,0:04:37.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,You rarely see the whole
Dialogue: 4,0:04:37.22,0:04:39.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,of another person's life.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:39.22,0:04:41.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let this verse bring you back
Dialogue: 4,0:04:41.26,0:04:43.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,to an honest starting place.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:43.41,0:04:45.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can work with the capacity
Dialogue: 4,0:04:45.66,0:04:47.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,you have today and ask
Dialogue: 4,0:04:47.31,0:04:48.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,God to guide it.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:49.69,0:04:49.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,God,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:49.99,0:04:52.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring you the comparison that leaves
Dialogue: 4,0:04:52.83,0:04:55.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,me discouraged before I have started.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:55.78,0:04:57.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,I remember what I once
Dialogue: 4,0:04:57.44,0:04:59.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,accomplished quickly,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:59.03,0:05:00.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,or I see what others seem
Dialogue: 4,0:05:00.93,0:05:03.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,to finish without effort.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:03.00,0:05:05.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me stop using those pictures
Dialogue: 4,0:05:05.56,0:05:07.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,to measure every hour
Dialogue: 4,0:05:07.19,0:05:08.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,of my own life.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:08.53,0:05:10.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,Teach me to recognize
Dialogue: 4,0:05:10.22,0:05:13.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,the responsibilities and circumstances
Dialogue: 4,0:05:13.26,0:05:15.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,that are actually mine.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:15.28,0:05:16.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me gratitude
Dialogue: 4,0:05:16.54,0:05:18.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,for the good I can do today,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:18.60,0:05:21.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,and generosity toward those whose
Dialogue: 4,0:05:21.04,0:05:23.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,path looks different from mine.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:24.51,0:05:26.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord, when I feel worn down,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:26.69,0:05:29.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,my inner voice can become severe.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:29.44,0:05:31.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,I turn one unfinished task
Dialogue: 4,0:05:31.72,0:05:35.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,into a long accusation against myself.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:35.21,0:05:38.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,Please help me speak truthfully about
Dialogue: 4,0:05:38.07,0:05:41.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,what needs doing without adding cruelty.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:41.34,0:05:43.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where I have neglected something,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:43.78,0:05:45.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,lead me to address it.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:45.58,0:05:48.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where I have reached a real limit,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:48.00,0:05:50.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,teach me to acknowledge it.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:50.11,0:05:52.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,Make room in my thinking for patience,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:52.95,0:05:54.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,learning, and mercy,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:54.45,0:05:56.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,so I can use the strength
Dialogue: 4,0:05:56.32,0:05:59.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have on what will actually help.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:00.04,0:06:02.25,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}But they that wait upon the LORD
Dialogue: 5,0:06:02.25,0:06:04.29,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}shall renew their strength;
Dialogue: 5,0:06:04.29,0:06:05.69,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}they shall mount up
Dialogue: 5,0:06:05.69,0:06:07.42,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}with wings as eagles;
Dialogue: 5,0:06:07.42,0:06:08.71,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}they shall run,
Dialogue: 5,0:06:08.71,0:06:10.35,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and not be weary;
Dialogue: 5,0:06:10.35,0:06:11.83,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and they shall walk,
Dialogue: 5,0:06:11.83,0:06:13.22,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and not faint.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:14.34,0:06:17.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can picture the eagle rising,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:17.08,0:06:18.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,then notice that Isaiah
Dialogue: 4,0:06:18.99,0:06:21.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,also speaks of walking.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:21.08,0:06:23.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may be facing a day made
Dialogue: 4,0:06:23.58,0:06:25.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,mostly of ordinary steps.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:25.99,0:06:28.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can wait upon the Lord while
Dialogue: 4,0:06:28.23,0:06:30.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,you prepare for those steps:
Dialogue: 4,0:06:30.37,0:06:32.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,listening to Scripture,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:32.16,0:06:33.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,asking for wisdom,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:33.56,0:06:34.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,receiving help.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:34.90,0:06:36.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not need to force
Dialogue: 4,0:06:36.80,0:06:38.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,a soaring feeling.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:38.39,0:06:40.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let this promise direct your hope
Dialogue: 4,0:06:40.87,0:06:42.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,toward God as you decide how
Dialogue: 4,0:06:42.97,0:06:45.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,to live the next hour faithfully.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:46.63,0:06:47.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:47.19,0:06:50.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,I wait before you with the questions
Dialogue: 4,0:06:50.04,0:06:52.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,I cannot hurry into answers.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:52.44,0:06:54.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,I want relief, clarity,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:54.28,0:06:56.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,and a simpler way forward.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:56.53,0:06:57.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,Teach me to remain
Dialogue: 4,0:06:57.97,0:07:00.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,attentive while I wait.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:00.00,0:07:02.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep me willing to hear advice,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:02.39,0:07:04.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,reconsider an assumption,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:04.32,0:07:07.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,or take a step I have overlooked.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:07.04,0:07:10.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,When waiting exposes my impatience,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:10.00,0:07:12.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,receive that confession too.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:12.54,0:07:14.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,I entrust the timing
Dialogue: 4,0:07:14.10,0:07:15.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,beyond my reach to you,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:15.89,0:07:18.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,and I ask for grace to respond
Dialogue: 4,0:07:18.23,0:07:21.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,faithfully to what is within my reach.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:22.38,0:07:24.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can loosen your hands now,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:24.61,0:07:26.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,if that is comfortable.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:26.50,0:07:28.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may silently name the matter
Dialogue: 4,0:07:28.78,0:07:30.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,you keep trying to settle.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:30.80,0:07:32.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,Offer it to God,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:32.06,0:07:34.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,then allow these few quiet seconds
Dialogue: 4,0:07:34.74,0:07:38.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,to pass without rehearsing an answer.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:43.83,0:07:44.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:44.20,0:07:45.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have sometimes watched
Dialogue: 4,0:07:45.98,0:07:47.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,for an answer so closely
Dialogue: 4,0:07:47.76,0:07:50.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,that the rest of the morning disappears.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:50.90,0:07:52.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me discernment about
Dialogue: 4,0:07:52.74,0:07:54.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,when to check again and when
Dialogue: 4,0:07:54.81,0:07:56.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,to put the screen aside.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:56.76,0:07:59.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me use the interval well.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:59.39,0:08:00.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,There is a person
Dialogue: 4,0:08:00.76,0:08:02.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can listen to,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:02.05,0:08:03.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,a room I can care for,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:03.83,0:08:05.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,a small piece of work
Dialogue: 4,0:08:05.53,0:08:06.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can finish.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:06.76,0:08:09.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let patient trust restore some
Dialogue: 4,0:08:09.04,0:08:11.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,space in my attention for the life
Dialogue: 4,0:08:11.62,0:08:14.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,that is happening around me.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:14.94,0:08:15.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,God,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:15.25,0:08:16.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring you the prayer
Dialogue: 4,0:08:16.99,0:08:19.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have spoken many times.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:19.15,0:08:20.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,I still hope for change,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:20.96,0:08:22.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,and I sometimes struggle
Dialogue: 4,0:08:22.78,0:08:24.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,to know what to say.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:24.47,0:08:27.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,Receive the words I have today.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:27.21,0:08:29.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep me from drawing a harsh
Dialogue: 4,0:08:29.27,0:08:31.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,conclusion about your care
Dialogue: 4,0:08:31.18,0:08:33.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,from the length of my waiting.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:33.58,0:08:35.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lead me toward wise counsel
Dialogue: 4,0:08:35.90,0:08:37.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,when I am confused.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:37.72,0:08:39.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,Hold me close to the truth
Dialogue: 4,0:08:39.61,0:08:40.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can understand,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:40.85,0:08:43.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,and help me remain honest about
Dialogue: 4,0:08:43.10,0:08:45.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,the questions that continue
Dialogue: 4,0:08:45.07,0:08:46.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,to trouble me.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:47.26,0:08:49.24,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Wait on the LORD:
Dialogue: 5,0:08:49.24,0:08:50.59,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}be of good courage,
Dialogue: 5,0:08:50.59,0:08:53.34,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and he shall strengthen thine heart:
Dialogue: 5,0:08:53.34,0:08:55.80,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}wait, I say, on the LORD.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:56.93,0:08:59.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,You hear waiting and courage
Dialogue: 4,0:08:59.02,0:09:00.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,together in this psalm.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:00.91,0:09:03.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may need courage to stay
Dialogue: 4,0:09:03.13,0:09:04.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,with a slow process,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:04.72,0:09:06.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,or you may need it to act.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:06.96,0:09:09.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,Think of one responsibility you have
Dialogue: 4,0:09:09.68,0:09:12.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,been avoiding because you feel depleted.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:12.88,0:09:14.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can reduce it
Dialogue: 4,0:09:14.21,0:09:15.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,to a first step.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:15.64,0:09:17.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can ask someone to sit
Dialogue: 4,0:09:17.62,0:09:19.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,beside you while you begin.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:19.85,0:09:22.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let the psalm accompany that step,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:22.23,0:09:24.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,giving your request for strength
Dialogue: 4,0:09:24.46,0:09:27.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,a clear and practical direction.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:27.88,0:09:28.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:28.26,0:09:29.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place the difficult
Dialogue: 4,0:09:29.88,0:09:31.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,first step before you.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:31.75,0:09:33.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it is the call,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:33.60,0:09:34.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,the form,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:34.32,0:09:37.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,or the conversation I keep postponing.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:37.56,0:09:39.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me prepare the few
Dialogue: 4,0:09:39.25,0:09:41.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,things I need to begin.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:41.11,0:09:42.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me clear words
Dialogue: 4,0:09:42.54,0:09:44.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,for what I know and the humility
Dialogue: 4,0:09:44.95,0:09:45.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,to say what I
Dialogue: 4,0:09:45.93,0:09:47.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,still need to understand.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:47.99,0:09:50.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can take this step without
Dialogue: 4,0:09:50.26,0:09:53.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,completing the entire process today.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:53.36,0:09:55.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,Be present in my effort,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:55.13,0:09:57.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,and teach me to leave space
Dialogue: 4,0:09:57.13,0:09:59.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,for another person's response.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:00.53,0:10:01.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:01.07,0:10:03.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,I offer you the work awaiting me,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:03.64,0:10:05.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,whether paid, unpaid,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:05.28,0:10:07.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,or still being sought.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:07.17,0:10:09.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let me see the people who depend
Dialogue: 4,0:10:09.44,0:10:11.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,on its care and accuracy.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:11.38,0:10:12.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me make choices
Dialogue: 4,0:10:12.82,0:10:15.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,that protect what matters most.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:15.24,0:10:17.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,If my load is too great,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:17.08,0:10:19.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,give me words to explain it before
Dialogue: 4,0:10:19.69,0:10:22.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,resentment shapes my conduct.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:22.09,0:10:24.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where I can share responsibility,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:24.62,0:10:26.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me do so thoughtfully.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:26.86,0:10:28.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask for steady judgment,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:28.86,0:10:31.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,especially when several people
Dialogue: 4,0:10:31.18,0:10:33.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,want an immediate answer.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:34.29,0:10:34.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,God,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:34.63,0:10:37.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,teach me to make promises with care.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:37.86,0:10:40.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,I sometimes agree too quickly because
Dialogue: 4,0:10:40.59,0:10:43.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,I am afraid of disappointing someone,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:43.31,0:10:44.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,then carry a burden
Dialogue: 4,0:10:44.71,0:10:46.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,I should have discussed.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:46.66,0:10:48.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me consider my time
Dialogue: 4,0:10:48.40,0:10:50.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,and strength before I answer.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:50.68,0:10:52.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me kindness when I need
Dialogue: 4,0:10:52.94,0:10:55.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,to suggest another date or
Dialogue: 4,0:10:55.04,0:10:56.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,ask for assistance.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:56.75,0:10:58.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let the commitments I do make
Dialogue: 4,0:10:58.75,0:11:00.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,receive faithful attention.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:00.79,0:11:02.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,I want the people around me
Dialogue: 4,0:11:02.94,0:11:04.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,to be able to trust both
Dialogue: 4,0:11:04.86,0:11:07.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,my willingness and my honesty.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:08.43,0:11:10.54,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}It is of the LORD's mercies
Dialogue: 5,0:11:10.54,0:11:12.49,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}that we are not consumed,
Dialogue: 5,0:11:12.49,0:11:15.42,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}because his compassions fail not.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:16.55,0:11:18.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,They are new every morning:
Dialogue: 5,0:11:18.97,0:11:21.56,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}great is thy faithfulness.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:22.69,0:11:25.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,These words come from Lamentations,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:25.12,0:11:26.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,a book that gives
Dialogue: 4,0:11:26.29,0:11:28.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,suffering room to speak.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:28.14,0:11:29.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can hear them while
Dialogue: 4,0:11:29.83,0:11:31.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,yesterday still hurts.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:31.62,0:11:33.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can receive the morning as
Dialogue: 4,0:11:33.80,0:11:35.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,an occasion for mercy even if
Dialogue: 4,0:11:35.90,0:11:38.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,you have something difficult to repair.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:38.91,0:11:40.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are allowed to tell
Dialogue: 4,0:11:40.56,0:11:42.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,the truth about both.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:42.24,0:11:43.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let God's faithfulness
Dialogue: 4,0:11:43.86,0:11:45.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,meet you where you stand,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:45.69,0:11:47.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,with room for sorrow,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:47.23,0:11:48.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,forgiveness,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:48.11,0:11:50.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,and whatever faithful beginning
Dialogue: 4,0:11:50.38,0:11:52.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,you are able to make today.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:53.54,0:11:54.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,Merciful Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:54.81,0:11:57.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring yesterday's impatience
Dialogue: 4,0:11:57.21,0:11:59.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the moment I wish I had
Dialogue: 4,0:11:59.36,0:12:01.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,handled differently.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:01.14,0:12:03.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,Please forgive what was unkind
Dialogue: 4,0:12:03.65,0:12:05.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,in my words or choices.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:05.76,0:12:07.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,Show me the repair
Dialogue: 4,0:12:07.10,0:12:08.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,that belongs to me:
Dialogue: 4,0:12:08.69,0:12:10.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,a direct apology,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:10.21,0:12:11.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,a corrected detail,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:11.91,0:12:14.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,a promise attended to.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:14.06,0:12:16.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me approach it without making
Dialogue: 4,0:12:16.60,0:12:18.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,the other person responsible
Dialogue: 4,0:12:18.69,0:12:21.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,for easing all my discomfort.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:21.04,0:12:22.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,I receive your mercy as
Dialogue: 4,0:12:22.96,0:12:25.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,I turn toward better conduct.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:25.55,0:12:27.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me a teachable heart
Dialogue: 4,0:12:27.34,0:12:29.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,for this new morning.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:30.02,0:12:30.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:30.40,0:12:31.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,let mercy be visible
Dialogue: 4,0:12:31.94,0:12:34.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the place where I live.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:34.12,0:12:36.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,When familiar noises or repeated
Dialogue: 4,0:12:36.73,0:12:38.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,requests meet my tiredness,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:38.94,0:12:41.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me answer with consideration.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:41.90,0:12:44.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,Remind me to explain what I need
Dialogue: 4,0:12:44.41,0:12:47.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,before irritation does the talking.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:47.34,0:12:49.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,Guide us toward a fairer
Dialogue: 4,0:12:49.30,0:12:51.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,sharing of the ordinary jobs.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:51.84,0:12:53.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let me notice effort
Dialogue: 4,0:12:53.39,0:12:55.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,that usually goes unmentioned.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:55.90,0:12:58.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,I pray for a home where tired
Dialogue: 4,0:12:58.20,0:13:00.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,people can speak honestly,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:00.26,0:13:02.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,receive practical kindness,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:02.40,0:13:04.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,and find space to recover
Dialogue: 4,0:13:04.38,0:13:06.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,their patience together.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:07.47,0:13:08.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:08.05,0:13:09.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,I remember those
Dialogue: 4,0:13:09.39,0:13:11.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,who depend on my care.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:11.40,0:13:13.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,Strengthen my tenderness when
Dialogue: 4,0:13:13.57,0:13:15.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,the same need returns again.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:15.85,0:13:18.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me pay attention to the person
Dialogue: 4,0:13:18.43,0:13:20.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,before me and recognize
Dialogue: 4,0:13:20.12,0:13:22.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,what they are trying to express.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:22.66,0:13:24.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,I also bring my own
Dialogue: 4,0:13:24.29,0:13:25.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,need for company,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:25.75,0:13:27.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,relief, and rest.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:27.39,0:13:29.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,Guide me toward people who can
Dialogue: 4,0:13:29.73,0:13:31.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,share this responsibility.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:31.94,0:13:33.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let asking for help become
Dialogue: 4,0:13:33.86,0:13:35.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,part of caring well,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:35.33,0:13:37.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,so that love has room to remain
Dialogue: 4,0:13:37.62,0:13:39.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,patient through the ordinary
Dialogue: 4,0:13:39.68,0:13:41.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,repetitions of this day.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:42.64,0:13:45.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,God is our refuge and strength,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:45.17,0:13:48.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,a very present help in trouble.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:49.19,0:13:51.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can take this short verse
Dialogue: 4,0:13:51.41,0:13:53.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,into a difficult room or a
Dialogue: 4,0:13:53.40,0:13:55.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,demanding appointment.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:55.26,0:13:57.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can remember it while
Dialogue: 4,0:13:57.01,0:13:59.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,you wait for your turn to speak.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:59.43,0:14:01.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can let it help you ask
Dialogue: 4,0:14:01.41,0:14:03.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,for support plainly.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:03.06,0:14:05.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,The psalm speaks of help in trouble,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:05.65,0:14:07.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,and you can pray from within
Dialogue: 4,0:14:07.66,0:14:09.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,the situation you face.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:09.50,0:14:12.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,Hold these words beside the practical
Dialogue: 4,0:14:12.17,0:14:13.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,help available to you as
Dialogue: 4,0:14:13.91,0:14:16.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,you consider what comes next.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:17.18,0:14:17.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,God,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:17.54,0:14:21.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place my practical needs before you:
Dialogue: 4,0:14:21.10,0:14:21.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,the bills,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:21.84,0:14:23.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,the household supplies,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:23.54,0:14:25.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the uncertainty about
Dialogue: 4,0:14:25.40,0:14:27.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,what will be enough.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:27.06,0:14:28.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me steadiness to look
Dialogue: 4,0:14:28.92,0:14:31.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,at the actual numbers and seek
Dialogue: 4,0:14:31.06,0:14:32.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,trustworthy information.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:32.96,0:14:34.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me ask about support
Dialogue: 4,0:14:34.84,0:14:37.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,that is available and discuss
Dialogue: 4,0:14:37.02,0:14:39.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,a difficulty before it grows.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:39.38,0:14:41.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,Guide my choices toward
Dialogue: 4,0:14:41.48,0:14:43.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,what is necessary.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:43.30,0:14:45.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,I pray for honest opportunities
Dialogue: 4,0:14:45.72,0:14:47.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,and wise assistance,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:47.28,0:14:49.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,and for the patience to work
Dialogue: 4,0:14:49.47,0:14:51.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,through one manageable part
Dialogue: 4,0:14:51.58,0:14:54.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,of the situation at a time.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:54.87,0:14:55.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:55.27,0:14:56.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,I pray for the part
Dialogue: 4,0:14:56.80,0:14:59.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,of my life affected by pain,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:59.06,0:15:01.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,illness, or persistent fatigue.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:01.75,0:15:04.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring my desire for relief
Dialogue: 4,0:15:04.10,0:15:06.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,and my frustration with what
Dialogue: 4,0:15:06.44,0:15:08.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,remains difficult.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:08.14,0:15:09.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,Grant wisdom to those
Dialogue: 4,0:15:09.79,0:15:11.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,helping with my care.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:11.62,0:15:14.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me describe what I am experiencing
Dialogue: 4,0:15:14.60,0:15:17.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,clearly and follow sound guidance.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:17.37,0:15:19.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me courage to ask questions
Dialogue: 4,0:15:19.92,0:15:22.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,when I need understanding.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:22.18,0:15:23.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let kindness surround
Dialogue: 4,0:15:23.84,0:15:25.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,the work of treatment,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:25.58,0:15:27.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,recovery, or adaptation,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:27.48,0:15:29.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,and sustain my hope through
Dialogue: 4,0:15:29.62,0:15:32.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,the days that require patience.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:33.26,0:15:36.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let yourself rest in this brief quiet.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:36.38,0:15:37.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can name the kind
Dialogue: 4,0:15:37.83,0:15:39.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,of help you need most.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:39.53,0:15:41.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can bring that need
Dialogue: 4,0:15:41.26,0:15:42.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,to God in a few words,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:42.92,0:15:45.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,leaving room to listen before
Dialogue: 4,0:15:45.10,0:15:47.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,this prayer continues.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:52.94,0:15:53.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:53.46,0:15:55.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,I remember what I have lost
Dialogue: 4,0:15:55.47,0:15:57.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the person whose absence
Dialogue: 4,0:15:57.55,0:16:00.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,becomes clear again each morning.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:00.18,0:16:01.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,Some ordinary tasks
Dialogue: 4,0:16:01.83,0:16:04.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,carry unexpected sorrow.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:04.09,0:16:07.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,Be near as I encounter them today.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:07.24,0:16:09.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me accept the kindness
Dialogue: 4,0:16:09.12,0:16:11.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,of someone who remembers with me.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:11.60,0:16:14.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me freedom to speak a name,
Dialogue: 4,0:16:14.13,0:16:15.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,shed a tear,
Dialogue: 4,0:16:15.08,0:16:17.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,or take a needed pause.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:17.07,0:16:18.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask for strength to care
Dialogue: 4,0:16:18.98,0:16:21.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,for the present while holding the love
Dialogue: 4,0:16:21.76,0:16:23.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,and memories that remain
Dialogue: 4,0:16:23.52,0:16:25.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,part of my life.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:25.87,0:16:27.53,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Then he said unto them,
Dialogue: 5,0:16:27.53,0:16:29.34,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Go your way, eat the fat,
Dialogue: 5,0:16:29.34,0:16:30.79,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and drink the sweet,
Dialogue: 5,0:16:30.79,0:16:32.75,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and send portions unto them
Dialogue: 5,0:16:32.75,0:16:35.03,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for whom nothing is prepared:
Dialogue: 5,0:16:35.03,0:16:36.82,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for this day is holy
Dialogue: 5,0:16:36.82,0:16:38.26,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}unto our Lord:
Dialogue: 5,0:16:38.26,0:16:40.38,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}neither be ye sorry;
Dialogue: 5,0:16:40.38,0:16:42.10,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for the joy of the LORD
Dialogue: 5,0:16:42.10,0:16:43.72,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}is your strength.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:44.85,0:16:47.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,Notice the food and the portions
Dialogue: 4,0:16:47.27,0:16:49.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,being sent to others.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:49.04,0:16:50.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,You have heard about joy
Dialogue: 4,0:16:50.69,0:16:52.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the middle of shared life.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:52.86,0:16:54.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can let that detail
Dialogue: 4,0:16:54.57,0:16:56.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,shape your morning.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:56.16,0:16:58.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,You might receive a meal with thanks
Dialogue: 4,0:16:58.85,0:17:00.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,or remember someone who
Dialogue: 4,0:17:00.57,0:17:02.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,could use company.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:02.10,0:17:04.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can allow a small moment
Dialogue: 4,0:17:04.36,0:17:06.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,of gladness without explaining
Dialogue: 4,0:17:06.79,0:17:08.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,away your sorrow.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:08.34,0:17:10.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can practice care while you wait,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:10.99,0:17:12.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,and leave room for care
Dialogue: 4,0:17:12.64,0:17:14.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,to reach you too.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:15.04,0:17:15.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:15.40,0:17:17.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me notice who might be missing
Dialogue: 4,0:17:17.87,0:17:20.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,from the circle of care around me.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:20.45,0:17:22.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,Perhaps there is a neighbour
Dialogue: 4,0:17:22.66,0:17:23.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,eating alone,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:23.68,0:17:25.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,a colleague under strain,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:25.64,0:17:27.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,or a friend too tired
Dialogue: 4,0:17:27.30,0:17:28.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,to prepare much.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:28.74,0:17:30.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,Show me a kindness that fits
Dialogue: 4,0:17:30.86,0:17:33.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,my means and their actual need.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:33.40,0:17:35.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me ask rather than assume.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:35.94,0:17:38.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,Whether I share food, time,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:38.09,0:17:39.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,or a useful errand,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:39.60,0:17:42.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,let my offering carry respect.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:42.16,0:17:44.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep me grateful for the people whose
Dialogue: 4,0:17:44.91,0:17:47.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,quiet generosity has sustained me.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:48.61,0:17:49.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:49.20,0:17:51.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,open my attention to the goodness
Dialogue: 4,0:17:51.96,0:17:53.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,already within reach.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:53.89,0:17:56.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,I thank you for familiar voices,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:56.49,0:17:58.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,clean water, a place to sit,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:58.77,0:18:02.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,and moments when someone makes me laugh.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:02.20,0:18:03.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,I want to receive such
Dialogue: 4,0:18:03.91,0:18:05.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,gifts more fully.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:05.41,0:18:07.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,When my heart feels dull,
Dialogue: 4,0:18:07.28,0:18:09.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,keep me patient with it.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:09.26,0:18:11.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let gratitude begin with one
Dialogue: 4,0:18:11.58,0:18:13.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,thing I can honestly name.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:13.92,0:18:16.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,As I notice and receive that gift,
Dialogue: 4,0:18:16.52,0:18:18.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,teach me to make space
Dialogue: 4,0:18:18.21,0:18:21.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,for the joy of belonging to you.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:21.84,0:18:23.38,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}And he said unto me,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:23.38,0:18:26.03,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}My grace is sufficient for thee:
Dialogue: 4,0:18:26.03,0:18:27.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,for my strength is made
Dialogue: 4,0:18:27.82,0:18:29.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,perfect in weakness.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:29.56,0:18:31.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,Most gladly therefore will
Dialogue: 4,0:18:31.59,0:18:34.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,I rather glory in my infirmities,
Dialogue: 4,0:18:34.17,0:18:36.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,that the power of Christ
Dialogue: 4,0:18:36.04,0:18:37.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,may rest upon me.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:38.85,0:18:40.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,Paul speaks about grace
Dialogue: 4,0:18:40.64,0:18:42.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,while describing weakness.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:42.84,0:18:44.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can bring a lasting
Dialogue: 4,0:18:44.59,0:18:46.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,limitation into this reading.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:46.97,0:18:48.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may still need a slower
Dialogue: 4,0:18:48.92,0:18:50.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,pace or help from another
Dialogue: 4,0:18:50.72,0:18:52.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,person when the prayer ends.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:52.91,0:18:55.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can receive that help with dignity.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:55.86,0:18:58.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can seek Christ's strength
Dialogue: 4,0:18:58.02,0:19:00.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,within the life you actually have.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:00.63,0:19:03.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let these words release you from having
Dialogue: 4,0:19:03.27,0:19:05.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,to look impressive before you ask
Dialogue: 4,0:19:05.50,0:19:08.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,for the grace to remain faithful.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:08.92,0:19:09.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,Jesus,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:09.41,0:19:12.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place before you the difficulty
Dialogue: 4,0:19:12.12,0:19:15.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,that has lasted longer than I expected.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:15.50,0:19:17.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have learned details about
Dialogue: 4,0:19:17.69,0:19:19.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,it I never wanted to learn.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:19.98,0:19:21.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,Meet me with your grace
Dialogue: 4,0:19:21.95,0:19:24.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the routines it requires.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:24.52,0:19:26.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep discouragement from
Dialogue: 4,0:19:26.38,0:19:28.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,making every decision for me.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:28.82,0:19:32.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me recognize a useful adjustment,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:32.00,0:19:33.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,a wise companion,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:33.43,0:19:36.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,and a good moment when one comes.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:36.38,0:19:39.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask for endurance that stays tender
Dialogue: 4,0:19:39.26,0:19:41.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,toward others and for a faith
Dialogue: 4,0:19:41.52,0:19:44.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,that can speak honestly about weariness.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:45.81,0:19:46.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:46.20,0:19:48.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,give me words for the help
Dialogue: 4,0:19:48.20,0:19:49.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,I need today.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:49.38,0:19:50.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can ask someone
Dialogue: 4,0:19:50.76,0:19:52.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,to cover a task,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:52.06,0:19:53.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,explain a step,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:53.28,0:19:56.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,or accompany me to an appointment.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:56.22,0:19:58.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me make that request clearly
Dialogue: 4,0:19:58.66,0:20:00.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,and allow the other person
Dialogue: 4,0:20:00.58,0:20:02.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,to answer freely.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:02.01,0:20:03.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,When assistance comes,
Dialogue: 4,0:20:03.62,0:20:05.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,let me receive it with thanks.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:05.99,0:20:09.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep me from apologizing for my whole
Dialogue: 4,0:20:09.06,0:20:11.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,existence because I have a need.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:11.91,0:20:14.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,Teach me the humility of belonging
Dialogue: 4,0:20:14.58,0:20:17.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,among people who sometimes give
Dialogue: 4,0:20:17.02,0:20:19.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,care and sometimes receive it.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:20.55,0:20:23.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,My flesh and my heart faileth:
Dialogue: 4,0:20:23.21,0:20:25.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,but God is the strength
Dialogue: 4,0:20:25.07,0:20:26.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,of my heart,
Dialogue: 4,0:20:26.04,0:20:28.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,and my portion for ever.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:29.47,0:20:31.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can hear the honesty
Dialogue: 4,0:20:31.27,0:20:32.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,in this psalm.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:32.51,0:20:33.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can also hear
Dialogue: 4,0:20:33.77,0:20:35.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,where its hope rests.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:35.50,0:20:37.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,When your usual abilities
Dialogue: 4,0:20:37.42,0:20:38.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,feel uncertain,
Dialogue: 4,0:20:38.57,0:20:40.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,you may need a deeper place
Dialogue: 4,0:20:40.64,0:20:42.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,to stand than yesterday's
Dialogue: 4,0:20:42.55,0:20:43.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,accomplishments.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:43.96,0:20:46.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can bring that desire to God.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:46.87,0:20:49.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can remember that a relationship
Dialogue: 4,0:20:49.66,0:20:51.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,with him reaches into seasons
Dialogue: 4,0:20:51.92,0:20:53.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,when life changes.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:53.49,0:20:55.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let this verse accompany you as
Dialogue: 4,0:20:55.71,0:20:58.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,you ask what faithfulness looks like
Dialogue: 4,0:20:58.28,0:21:00.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the season you are living now.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:01.82,0:21:02.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,Faithful God,
Dialogue: 4,0:21:02.91,0:21:04.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the future
Dialogue: 4,0:21:04.42,0:21:06.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,I cannot picture clearly.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:06.69,0:21:08.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,I wonder what will be asked
Dialogue: 4,0:21:08.49,0:21:10.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,of me and whether I will
Dialogue: 4,0:21:10.09,0:21:11.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,have enough strength.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:11.67,0:21:13.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,Please guide the decisions
Dialogue: 4,0:21:13.78,0:21:15.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,that can be made today.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:15.82,0:21:17.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,For what remains unknown,
Dialogue: 4,0:21:17.82,0:21:19.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me resist living every
Dialogue: 4,0:21:19.98,0:21:22.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,possible difficulty in advance.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:22.64,0:21:25.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,Root my hope in your enduring care.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:25.67,0:21:27.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me people with whom
Dialogue: 4,0:21:27.45,0:21:29.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can speak honestly,
Dialogue: 4,0:21:29.01,0:21:30.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,and teach me to receive
Dialogue: 4,0:21:30.72,0:21:32.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,the ordinary provision of this
Dialogue: 4,0:21:32.94,0:21:35.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,day with an attentive heart.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:36.20,0:21:37.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,You have listened
Dialogue: 4,0:21:37.46,0:21:39.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,to Scripture about strength,
Dialogue: 4,0:21:39.55,0:21:41.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,mercy, courage, and grace.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:41.67,0:21:43.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,Now choose one reference
Dialogue: 4,0:21:43.43,0:21:45.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,you want within reach today.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:45.67,0:21:47.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,You might keep Isaiah
Dialogue: 4,0:21:47.36,0:21:48.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,chapter forty open,
Dialogue: 4,0:21:48.90,0:21:51.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,or write down Psalm twenty seven,
Dialogue: 4,0:21:51.56,0:21:52.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,verse fourteen.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:52.95,0:21:55.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can return to the actual passage
Dialogue: 4,0:21:55.68,0:21:58.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,when you have a quiet minute.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:58.06,0:22:00.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not need to remember
Dialogue: 4,0:22:00.02,0:22:02.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,every sentence of this prayer.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:02.38,0:22:05.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give yourself one clear place to turn
Dialogue: 4,0:22:05.22,0:22:08.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,when the morning begins to feel crowded.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:09.47,0:22:12.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,Return in your mind to Isaiah's
Dialogue: 4,0:22:12.27,0:22:14.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,final image of walking.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:14.53,0:22:16.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can carry that image
Dialogue: 4,0:22:16.40,0:22:18.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,into something simple:
Dialogue: 4,0:22:18.30,0:22:20.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,washing a cup, preparing a bag,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:20.78,0:22:22.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,or opening the work
Dialogue: 4,0:22:22.30,0:22:23.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,you need to do.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:23.68,0:22:26.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can give the next action enough
Dialogue: 4,0:22:26.17,0:22:28.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,attention to do it carefully.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:28.40,0:22:30.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,If you need to stop and rest,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:30.67,0:22:33.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,you can make room for that too.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:33.28,0:22:35.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are asking God to shape
Dialogue: 4,0:22:35.32,0:22:38.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,the way you travel through this day,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:38.03,0:22:40.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,one actual step after another.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:41.48,0:22:42.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:42.01,0:22:43.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,direct whatever strength
Dialogue: 4,0:22:43.83,0:22:46.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have toward what is good.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:46.05,0:22:47.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let me use it
Dialogue: 4,0:22:47.05,0:22:48.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,to keep my word,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:48.28,0:22:49.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,treat someone fairly,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:49.89,0:22:51.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,and finish the part
Dialogue: 4,0:22:51.35,0:22:53.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,of a task that matters.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:53.29,0:22:55.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,If an easier choice would
Dialogue: 4,0:22:55.18,0:22:56.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,harm another person,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:56.68,0:22:59.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,give me courage to choose carefully.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:59.58,0:23:02.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,If pride makes me resist correction,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:02.48,0:23:04.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,soften my response.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:04.19,0:23:07.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,I want endurance that serves love.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:07.08,0:23:09.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me recognize faithfulness
Dialogue: 4,0:23:09.36,0:23:10.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,in small decisions,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:10.81,0:23:13.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,including the ones that will never
Dialogue: 4,0:23:13.40,0:23:15.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,receive praise or attention.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:16.71,0:23:17.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,God,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:17.03,0:23:19.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,I pray for the tired people
Dialogue: 4,0:23:19.21,0:23:21.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,whose work supports my day.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:21.56,0:23:24.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,Remember those beginning an early shift,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:24.63,0:23:26.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,those caring for a family,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:26.63,0:23:28.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,and those searching
Dialogue: 4,0:23:28.09,0:23:29.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,for steady employment.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:29.96,0:23:32.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give wisdom to people making decisions
Dialogue: 4,0:23:32.85,0:23:35.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,that affect their rest and dignity.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:35.70,0:23:38.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,Make me considerate in the requests
Dialogue: 4,0:23:38.42,0:23:40.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place upon others.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:40.15,0:23:42.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where I have influence,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:42.09,0:23:44.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,teach me to use it responsibly.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:44.90,0:23:46.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let our shared life include
Dialogue: 4,0:23:46.95,0:23:48.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,room for honest limits,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:48.71,0:23:50.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,practical assistance,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:50.31,0:23:51.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the encouragement
Dialogue: 4,0:23:51.91,0:23:53.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,to continue together.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:54.69,0:23:56.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may make these words
Dialogue: 4,0:23:56.50,0:23:58.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,your own as we finish.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:58.33,0:23:58.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:58.85,0:24:01.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place my strength in your service.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:01.71,0:24:04.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,I receive your mercy for this morning.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:04.70,0:24:07.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will be truthful about my needs.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:07.62,0:24:10.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will welcome wise help.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:10.04,0:24:11.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will give the next
Dialogue: 4,0:24:11.46,0:24:13.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,faithful step my attention.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:13.56,0:24:14.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,Through Christ,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:14.66,0:24:16.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,teach me to wait with hope
Dialogue: 4,0:24:16.55,0:24:18.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,and to walk with love.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:19.53,0:24:21.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,Before you begin your next task,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:21.82,0:24:23.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,write one small action you can
Dialogue: 4,0:24:23.96,0:24:26.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,take in the next ten minutes.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:26.22,0:24:28.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,Make it specific:
Dialogue: 4,0:24:28.10,0:24:30.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,gather the papers for a call,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:30.36,0:24:32.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,wash what you need for breakfast,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:32.93,0:24:34.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,or ask someone to share
Dialogue: 4,0:24:34.72,0:24:36.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,a responsibility.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:36.22,0:24:37.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,Choose the action
Dialogue: 4,0:24:37.51,0:24:39.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,that belongs to your morning.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:39.88,0:24:42.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,Beside it, write Isaiah forty,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:42.64,0:24:43.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,thirty one.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:43.84,0:24:46.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,You now have a practical beginning
Dialogue: 4,0:24:46.42,0:24:49.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,and a Scripture reference to return
Dialogue: 4,0:24:49.08,0:24:51.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,to as you move into the day.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:52.60,0:24:53.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:53.02,0:24:56.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place that chosen action before you.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:56.38,0:24:58.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will begin with the time
Dialogue: 4,0:24:58.24,0:24:59.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,and strength available,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:59.88,0:25:02.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,accepting help where it is needed.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:02.49,0:25:05.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,Guide my attention as I start.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:05.30,0:25:07.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I notice hurry rising,
Dialogue: 4,0:25:07.41,0:25:09.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,bring me back to patient care.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:09.94,0:25:12.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I need to adjust the plan,
Dialogue: 4,0:25:12.46,0:25:13.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,give me wisdom.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:13.87,0:25:15.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,I offer you this morning
Dialogue: 4,0:25:15.78,0:25:17.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,through Jesus Christ,
Dialogue: 4,0:25:17.46,0:25:20.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,grateful that I can pray honestly,
Dialogue: 4,0:25:20.16,0:25:21.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,receive mercy,
Dialogue: 4,0:25:21.28,0:25:23.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,and take the next step
Dialogue: 4,0:25:23.03,0:25:25.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,in dependence on you.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:26.09,0:25:28.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,May the everlasting God strengthen
Dialogue: 4,0:25:28.82,0:25:31.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,your heart as this morning unfolds.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:31.81,0:25:33.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,May his compassion meet
Dialogue: 4,0:25:33.66,0:25:35.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,you in the places where you
Dialogue: 4,0:25:35.82,0:25:37.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,feel worn thin.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:37.20,0:25:38.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,May you find wisdom
Dialogue: 4,0:25:38.63,0:25:40.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,for your responsibilities,
Dialogue: 4,0:25:40.59,0:25:42.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,trustworthy help in your need,
Dialogue: 4,0:25:42.85,0:25:44.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,and courage for the action
Dialogue: 4,0:25:44.80,0:25:46.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,you have chosen.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:46.19,0:25:48.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,As you return to the sounds
Dialogue: 4,0:25:48.16,0:25:50.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,and movements of your day,
Dialogue: 4,0:25:50.05,0:25:51.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,may the words you have
Dialogue: 4,0:25:51.66,0:25:53.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,heard remain close,
Dialogue: 4,0:25:53.04,0:25:55.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,nurturing patience in your work
Dialogue: 4,0:25:55.30,0:25:58.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,and kindness toward yourself and others.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:59.60,0:26:01.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,If this prayer expresses
Dialogue: 4,0:26:01.39,0:26:04.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,what you are bringing to God today,
Dialogue: 4,0:26:04.00,0:26:06.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,you are welcome to write Amen.
Dialogue: 4,0:26:07.42,0:26:09.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,Take the small beginning you chose
Dialogue: 4,0:26:09.86,0:26:11.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,into the next ten minutes.
Dialogue: 4,0:26:11.90,0:26:13.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can leave the rest
Dialogue: 4,0:26:13.42,0:26:15.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,of the day in its place while
Dialogue: 4,0:26:15.42,0:26:17.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,you attend to this part.
Dialogue: 4,0:26:17.25,0:26:19.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep Isaiah's words nearby,
Dialogue: 4,0:26:19.30,0:26:21.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,and return to them when you need
Dialogue: 4,0:26:21.74,0:26:24.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,to remember whom you are waiting upon.
Dialogue: 4,0:26:24.81,0:26:27.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,May your morning carry the quiet
Dialogue: 4,0:26:27.07,0:26:29.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,courage of walking with God.
